    skos:prefLabel "Wallets and key management"@en ; skos:altLabel "Key management"@en , "Multisig"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Category for anything in the wallet business (Ledger, the company). Wallet software is also typed ceo:Wallet."@en .

